"the behavior is equivalent to the `write-sync` synchronization strategy.\n"
"====\n"
"\n"
"Available values:\n"
"\n"
"[cols=5]\n"
"!===\n"
".2+h!Strategy\n"
".2+h!Throughput\n"
"3+^h!Guarantees when the application thread resumes\n"
"\n"
"h!Changes applied\n"
"h!Changes safe from crash/power loss\n"
"h!Changes visible on search\n"
"\n"
"!async\n"
"!Best\n"
